    "blocks": {
      "Wysiwyg-header": {
        "id": "Wysiwyg-header",
        "type": "Wysiwyg",
        "value": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;\">[Report title] · [Organisation]</span></p>",
        "mediator": {
          "sourceMap": {}
        },
        "blockName": "Header",
        "blockWrapper": {
          "style": {
            "gridRowStart": "1",
            "gridRowEnd": "2",
            "gridColumnStart": "1",
            "gridColumnEnd": "9"
          },
          "classes": [],
          "gridSpan": 8,
          "documentRegion": "header"
        }
      },
      "Wysiwyg-report": {
        "id": "Wysiwyg-report",
        "type": "Wysiwyg",
        "value": "<p><br><br><br><br></p><h1>[Report title]</h1><p style=\"font-size: 1.2em;\">[A one-line subtitle that says what the report answers]</p><p><br></p><p>Prepared for [audience]<br>Prepared by [author, team]<br>[Month year]</p><hr class=\"pd-page-break\" data-page-break=\"true\"><h2>Executive summary</h2><p>[The answer first: what you found and what you recommend, in a short paragraph a busy reader can act on.]</p><ul><li>[Key finding]</li><li>[Key finding]</li><li>[Key finding]</li></ul><h2>1. Background</h2><p>[Why this report was written, the question it answers and what was in scope.]</p><h2>2. Method</h2><p>[Where the information came from, the period covered and any limits the reader should know about.]</p><h2>3. Findings</h2><h3>3.1 [Finding]</h3><p>[What the evidence shows and why it matters.]</p><table><thead><tr><th>Measure</th><th style=\"text-align: right;\">[Period 1]</th><th style=\"text-align: right;\">[Period 2]</th><th style=\"text-align: right;\">Change</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>[Measure]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0%]</td></tr><tr><td>[Measure]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0%]</td></tr><tr><td>[Measure]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0]</td><td style=\"text-align: right;\">[0%]</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>3.2 [Finding]</h3><p>[What the evidence shows and why it matters.]</p><h2>4. Recommendations</h2><ol><li><strong>[Recommendation]</strong> — [owner, cost, timing and expected result].</li><li><strong>[Recommendation]</strong> — [owner, cost, timing and expected result].</li></ol><h2>5. Conclusion</h2><p>[What happens next and when this will be reviewed.]</p><hr class=\"pd-page-break\" data-page-break=\"true\"><h2>Appendix A. [Supporting data]</h2><p>[Detailed tables, sources and definitions.]</p>",
        "mediator": {
          "sourceMap": {}
        },
        "blockName": "Report",
        "blockWrapper": {
          "style": {
            "gridRowStart": "1",
            "gridRowEnd": "75",
            "gridColumnStart": "1",
            "gridColumnEnd": "9"
          },
          "classes": [],
          "gridSpan": 8
        }
      },
      "Wysiwyg-page-numbers": {
